;; Two branches of an `if` that disagree: neither is the expectation, so the
;; message names them both as branches.

;; EXPECT-ERROR: Type error: two branches here give values of different types.
;; EXPECT-ERROR: one   (List string)
;; EXPECT-ERROR: other (List bool)
